thern Mariana Islands under the Edward Byrne Memorial Justice Assistance Grant (JAG) program. Currently, American Samoa and the Northern Mariana Islands are considered to be one state, and they split one JAG allocation with 67%...","summarySource":"crs","title":"Northern Mariana Islands and American Samoa Criminal Justice Support Act","type":"hr","url":"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/house-bill/5640"},{"bipartisan":false,"cosponsors":0,"crossPartyCosponsors":0,"id":"hr4408-119","introducedDate":"2025-07-15","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2025-07-16","text":"Referred to the Subcommittee on Economic Development, Public Buildings, and Emergency Management."},"number":"HR 4408","policyArea":"Emergency Management","ranked":true,"stage":"introduced","summary":"Directs the Federal Emergency Management Agency to study workforce hiring and retention practices in noncontiguous communities and revise related policies accordingly. Requires the Government Accountability Office to review disaster response effectiveness in noncontiguous versus contiguous communities and submit recommendations. Establishes a pilot program to test new technology for preliminary damage assessments in remote noncontiguous disaster areas.","summarySource":"ai","title":"UNITY Act","type":"hr","url":"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/house-bill/4408"},{"bipartisan":false,"cosponsors":0,"crossPartyCosponsors":0,"id":"hr4039-119","introducedDate":"2025-06-17","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2025-06-18","text":"Referred to the Subcommittee on Highways and Transit."},"number":"HR 4039","policyArea":"Transportation and Public Works","ranked":true,"stage":"introduced","summary":"Amends the Infrastructure Investment and Jobs Act to make the Commonwealth of the Northern Mariana Islands eligible to receive federal ferry service funding for establishing and operating basic essential ferry services in rural areas.","summarySource":"ai","title":"CNMI Ferry Act","type":"hr","url":"https://www.co